{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22655","headline":"立春日酬钱员外曲江同行见赠 · 白居易","name":"立春日酬钱员外曲江同行见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下直遇春日，垂鞭出禁闱。\n两人携手语，十里看山归。\n柳色早黄浅，水文新绿微。\n风光向晚好，车马近南稀。\n机尽笑相顾，不惊鸥鹭飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}